00:57:49.820 --> 00:57:57.820
coming out. Now, from the point of view of history, what happened in the last 40 years

00:57:57.820 --> 00:58:08.820
did not happen in 2,000 years. So we are going at a very fast speed and there is progress.

00:58:08.820 --> 00:58:14.820
You know, for instance, I'm very much a Fazi, but I tell you I'm very proud here that in

00:58:14.820 --> 00:58:19.320
that in Israel the barriers between the Padre and the children completely gone.

00:58:19.320 --> 00:58:20.320
They are gone.

00:58:20.320 --> 00:58:25.820
You know, the people, there is unity among the young people.

00:58:25.820 --> 00:58:27.820
There is positive unity.

00:58:27.820 --> 00:58:35.320
There is pride in the Jewish pastor on both on the party and the Jewish person.

00:58:35.320 --> 00:58:37.320
There is unity.

00:58:37.320 --> 00:58:42.320
And that would be even stronger at times for the Goliaths.

00:58:42.320 --> 00:58:46.820
So there is, now, there should be a Sanhedrin.

00:58:46.820 --> 00:58:51.320
I believe very strongly that maybe in the next 20 years, 30 years, 40 years, people

00:58:51.320 --> 00:58:54.320
will say, enough having conflicts between the rabbis.

00:58:54.320 --> 00:58:58.820
Let us have a Sanhedrin and the Sanhedrin should decide all religious matters.

00:58:58.820 --> 00:59:00.320
I think it's high time.

00:59:00.320 --> 00:59:06.820
I have a belief that it's high time to have a Sanhedrin, tell us what to do, what not

00:59:06.820 --> 00:59:07.820
to do.

00:59:07.820 --> 00:59:14.820
if the people are there, enough! I think that the time will come.

00:59:14.820 --> 00:59:19.820
You have to be careful. Remember that you want to watch the 27th of July.

00:59:19.820 --> 00:59:28.820
Do you think we can still go to work until the 7th of July?

00:59:28.820 --> 00:59:38.740
I don't know I am afraid sometimes to say that so much we are so eager to

00:59:38.740 --> 00:59:44.580
accomplish peace with the Arabs that maybe we were preparing the third world war

00:59:44.580 --> 00:59:51.280
I don't know I hope I could know maybe I hope you write I hope you write I hope

00:59:51.280 --> 00:59:55.480
very right Isaac

01:00:21.280 --> 01:00:23.260
thought in the world

01:00:23.260 --> 01:00:25.980
whoever conceived it, however it was conceived

01:00:25.980 --> 01:00:27.780
because it always gave you

01:00:27.780 --> 01:00:29.860
an aspiration for something to come

01:00:29.860 --> 01:00:31.060
to achieve something

01:00:31.060 --> 01:00:33.300
that sometimes you feel empty

01:00:33.300 --> 01:00:35.620
if we feel that we're

01:00:35.620 --> 01:00:37.800
approaching something so closely

01:00:37.800 --> 01:00:39.720
maybe then

01:00:39.720 --> 01:00:40.900
we get complacent

01:00:40.900 --> 01:00:43.880
over the idea that you have to strive for something

01:00:43.880 --> 01:00:44.940
that the research

01:00:44.940 --> 01:00:47.560
I don't know who's going to be able to prove ever

01:00:47.560 --> 01:00:49.940
who's going to be the descendant of David

01:00:49.940 --> 01:00:50.660
of David Amen

01:00:50.660 --> 01:00:58.660
I just wanted to ask about the concept that there is one, that the thought itself is a

01:00:58.660 --> 01:00:59.660
rabbit.

01:00:59.660 --> 01:01:00.660
Of course, of course.

01:01:00.660 --> 01:01:01.660
It's a very important thing.

01:01:01.660 --> 01:01:02.660
You know the young man here.

01:01:02.660 --> 01:01:03.660
He has a tendency to forget.

01:01:03.660 --> 01:01:04.660
We have a tendency to forget 2,000 years of ghettoism.

01:01:04.660 --> 01:01:05.660
We have a critique not to look back and see how much progress we made.

01:01:05.660 --> 01:01:06.660
You've answered that several times.

01:01:06.660 --> 01:01:07.660
I think that's a very important question.

01:01:07.660 --> 01:01:11.900
to forget 2,000 years of ghettoism.

01:01:11.900 --> 01:01:15.900
We have a to see, not to look back and see

01:01:15.900 --> 01:01:17.800
how much progress we've made.

01:01:17.800 --> 01:01:22.040
You've answered that in several conditions.

01:01:22.040 --> 01:01:23.940
And the other point that you made,

01:01:23.940 --> 01:01:30.760
that we very always lose track of, is Sinaf Khena.

01:01:30.760 --> 01:01:31.720
I mentioned this.

01:01:31.720 --> 01:01:32.680
You mentioned them?

01:01:32.680 --> 01:01:33.960
Yes, I mentioned Sinaf Khena.

01:01:33.960 --> 01:01:41.860
I would reiterate time and time again, our people are in pain.

01:01:42.460 --> 01:01:44.440
We have made considerable progress.

01:01:45.280 --> 01:01:52.880
We have made so much progress that when we look around, we accept the progress as normal.

01:01:53.300 --> 01:01:53.420
Yeah.

01:01:53.880 --> 01:01:55.320
It really is a progress.

01:01:55.460 --> 01:01:56.400
We made great progress.

01:01:56.800 --> 01:01:57.500
Great, great progress.

01:01:57.680 --> 01:01:58.900
I think that's it.

