are, I'm sorry to say, are the weakest ones. We tried to help them, we would have helped them,

01:02:50.260 --> 01:03:01.260
but let us not be pessimistic. We are, I tell you, if my grandfather, ala shalom, would have been able to see

01:03:01.260 --> 01:03:09.080
My granddaughters, our granddaughters, our grandfathers, they would have seen that the

01:03:09.080 --> 01:03:11.080
