I said, you?

01:04:43.080 --> 01:04:45.080
I didn't say that.

01:04:45.080 --> 01:04:47.080
I said, you?

01:04:47.080 --> 01:04:49.080
No.

01:04:49.080 --> 01:04:51.080
No.

01:04:51.080 --> 01:04:53.080
No.

01:04:53.080 --> 01:04:55.080
No.

01:04:55.080 --> 01:04:57.080
Thank God.

01:04:57.080 --> 01:04:59.080
Thank God.

01:04:59.080 --> 01:05:01.080
Thank God.

01:05:01.080 --> 01:05:03.080
Thank God.

01:05:03.080 --> 01:05:05.080
Thank God.

