in this

01:05:09.080 --> 01:05:19.080
This is part of the unification. We did not finish the job, but the biggest obstacle, I think, is the unification.

01:05:19.080 --> 01:05:25.080
And there will be more unity, and those who are, we lose them, I hope that we lose them momentarily,

01:05:25.080 --> 01:05:30.080
that maybe we will be able to get children, second children, we don't know.

01:05:30.080 --> 01:05:34.080
But the unity, the process of unity is un-extuated.

01:05:34.080 --> 01:05:47.080
Actually, it's unstoppable. There will be unity not only between the Bani Mesk and these, one day there will be unity between religious and irreligious.

01:05:47.080 --> 01:05:55.080
Pay attention. We put off that. Alright? So we are on our way. That's it.

